### Endpoint test cases (Step 1b)

```
Case 1 — short query:           GET .../search?q=ко           → []
Case 2 — valid product term:    GET .../search?q=шампоан      → up to 10 selecta_product items
Case 3 — title deduplication:   product matching title+index  → appears once
